> [Google] reader is dead to me. Or it will be on July 1, 2013.
My readers are numero uno. I WANT YOU TO STICK AROUND. So, here's how you can keep getting your Love & Loy[ally] fix. Let's face it, there's nothing better than an co-[dependent] relationship.
Click "Import from Google Reader"
After the import is finished, all the blogs you follow via Google Reader will be in your Blog[lov]in' feed. Yay!
BL is so much prettier than GR anyway.
Don't you worry... already made the switch. stupid google reader.

